elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">独立开发者利用Claude Code完成三元哥德巴赫猜想形式化证明</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成150亿美元新一轮融资，估值升至1.25万亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Edge0 正式开源 145B 端侧模型，实现个人电脑本地流畅运行</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联合三星等品牌开启Gemini智能眼镜预售，起售价395美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月12日正式开启Intelligent Eyewear系列智能眼镜预售，产品起售价为395美元。该设备由谷歌提供Gemini AI能力与核心系统支持，并联合三星、Gentle Monster及Warby Parker在硬件形态、工业设计与光学镜架方面进行深度合作，标志着Gemini助手正式落地端侧可穿戴硬件。针对公众关注的隐私问题，谷歌在服务条款中开创性引入“双向隐私”规定，明确禁止任何绕过系统隐私保护机制的违规拍摄或滥用行为。谷歌官方强调，为保障拍摄者与周围路人的隐私权益，公司保留对违规设备进行远程锁机的权力。此举通过技术与制度双重手段，为智能穿戴设备的隐私边界划定了底线，对行业内具身智能硬件的合规化发展具有重要参考意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布实时语音模型Hy Realtime，支持Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/95a0012445ce86041be0d1531a50a629.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元正式发布全新实时语音模型Hy Realtime，该模型在语音理解、指令遵循及拟人化表达方面表现优异，并新增Agentic工具调用与唱歌两大核心能力。Hy Realtime不仅具备联网搜索与执行任务的Agent属性，还实现了更自然的语音交互体验。目前，该模型已集成至元宝语音通话及腾讯客服等内部产品中，显著提升了数亿用户的对话交互质量。腾讯计划近期将Hy Realtime通过API形式接入腾讯云，向外部开发者全面开放。此举标志着腾讯自研语音技术从内部场景正式迈向外部生态，旨在为开发者提供更具竞争力的实时语音交互解决方案，替代此前依赖第三方服务的技术架构，进一步完善腾讯在AI语音领域的全链路布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">独立开发者利用Claude Code完成三元哥德巴赫猜想形式化证明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7981a991e67d57eb6ac49ba002353ea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">独立开发者Charlie Reams近日借助Claude Code成功完成了对三元哥德巴赫猜想的形式化证明，累计产出19.4万行Lean4代码，且所有数学推理均通过机器严格验证。在证明过程中，AI展现了极高的严谨性，自主识别并修补了数学家Harald Helfgott于2013年发表的原版证明中的11处关键漏洞，涵盖常数错误、不等式失效及引用偏差等问题。此外，AI将证明依赖的外部假设从5项精简至2项，显著提升了证明的严谨性。此次突破标志着数学界对“证明完成”的判定标准正从传统同行评议向机器可验证的形式化方向转变，展示了AI在基础科学研究领域的应用潜力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成150亿美元新一轮融资，估值升至1.25万亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日敲定新一轮150亿美元私募融资，融资前估值达到1.25万亿美元。该轮融资被定性为“机会性融资”，旨在为2027年启动的IPO储备资金。财务数据显示，OpenAI今年第三季度营收约100亿美元，环比增长近50%，但同期运营亏损高达109亿美元，调整后营业利润率为-109%，显示公司在模型训练、推理服务及数据中心建设方面仍面临巨大的资本开支压力。此次融资正值行业竞争加剧期，Anthropic计划于11月19日登陆纳斯达克，IPO估值上限预计达1.4万亿美元。随着两家头部AI公司相继走向公开市场，投资者将通过财报直接评估其营收增速与烧钱效率。OpenAI目前交易尚未正式收口，预计将在几周内完成，以确保在上市前拥有充足的现金流支撑业务运营。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Edge0 正式开源 145B 端侧模型，实现个人电脑本地流畅运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">开源项目 Edge0 近日发布并开源了 Edge0-145B 与 Edge0-120B 模型，标志着 1450 亿参数大模型首次实现个人电脑本地流畅运行。该模型通过稀疏专家架构（MoE）、端侧协同训练及三层存储智能流水线技术，在保持云端级编程与推理能力的同时，将内存占用降低 40% 至 60%。实测显示，Edge0-145B 在搭载苹果 M 系列芯片或 RTX 4090/5090 的设备上，峰值内存占用仅 29GB，解码速度超 80 tokens/s，支持 128K 至 256K 上下文。在 DeepSWE1.1 及 GPQA-Diamond 等基准测试中表现优异，可独立完成复杂代码生成、3D 建模及无人机控制等本地工作流。目前，Edge0 已在 Hugging Face 开源模型权重，并同步在 GitHub</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
